    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-09-10T15:56:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-10T15:56:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-10T06:26:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-10T06:26:00Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system centred south of the Bight extends a ridge across the south of SA. The main high centre will gradually move eastwards to be centred to the east of SA on Friday. A trough over the interior of WA will remain stationary but will weaken later Friday. Another low pressure trough will approach from the west on Saturday and move across SA on Sunday then a cold front will move across southern coasts later Monday. An upper disturbance will move over the far west on Monday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-09-10T15:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-11T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-10T05:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-10T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-09-11T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-12T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-10T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-11T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. The chance of fog and frost south of Yunta in the morning. Winds east to southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h tending south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 5 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching 23 to 29.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 3:20pm, UV Index predicted to reach 7 [High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-09-12T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-13T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-11T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-12T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds northeast to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending north to northeasterly in the morning then tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 16 with daytime temperatures reaching 26 to 32.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-09-13T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-14T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-12T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-13T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower south of Yunta, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm south of Leigh Creek in the afternoon and evening. Winds northwest to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly during the day then becoming light during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 13 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 29 to 34.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-09-14T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-15T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-13T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-14T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Leigh Creek in the morning and afternoon. Winds northwest to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly during the day then tending southeast to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 13 and 18 with daytime temperatures reaching 28 to 35.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
